  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring of environment and natural resources NR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">uppf&#xF6;ljning milj&#xF6; och naturresursprojekt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring of environment and natural resources project &quot;Water Resources Irrigation Project&quot; (WRIP) and Environmental Services Project&quot; (ESP), co-funded by Sida and the World Bank, with a contracted expert with an estimated budget of 1,199,880 sek. In total Sida contributes with 103 (35 och 68) msek with grants and IBRD-funding amounts to 45 (40+5) mUSD (ca. 370 mSEK) and in addition there is some funding from GEF funding. The World Bank undertakes a semi-annual and annual mission per year under 2015-2016 for each of the two projects. The expert will take part in 3 missions per year which amounts to 6 missions for the period 2015 and 2016. Contracting of the expert is made with Sida&apos;s framework agreement for Agriculture Forestry and Environment  where ORGUT Consulting AB is ranked first. The expert will support the Embassy with quality assurance with regard to the Albanian government execution of the of two projects (WRIP and ESP). It involves to verify that the projects are in line with the by the Swedish government adopted Results strategy for Sweden&#x2019;s reform cooperation with Eastern Europe, the Western Balkans and Turkey 2014 &#x2013; 2020 and with the Swedish Feminist foreign policy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Uppf&#xF6;ljning av milj&#xF6; och naturresursprojekt &quot;Water Resouces Irrigation Project&quot; (WRIP) och Environmental Services Project&quot; (ESP) samfinansierade av Sida och V&#xE4;rldsbanken med upphandlat expertst&#xF6;d kostnadsber&#xE4;knat till 1,199,880 sek. Sida bidrar totalt med 103 (35 och 68) msek i g&#xE5;vomedel och IBRD l&#xE5;nen uppg&#xE5;r till 45 (40+5) mUSD (ca.370 msek) dessutom tillkommer st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n GEF. V&#xE4;rldsbanken genomf&#xF6;r en halv&#xE5;rs och &#xE5;rsgenomg&#xE5;ng under 2015-2016 f&#xF6;r varje projekt (ESP och WRIP) och experten kommer att medverka vid n&#xE5;gra av missionerna. Experten ber&#xE4;knas g&#xF6;ra tre resor om &#xE5;ret, vilket ger totalt 6 resor f&#xF6;r perioden 2015-2016. Kontraktering  genomf&#xF6;rs med Sidas ramavtal for Jord- och skogsbruk och milj&#xF6; d&#xE4;r ORGUT &#xE4;r rankad f&#xF6;rst. Expertst&#xF6;det bidrar till att kvalitetss&#xE4;kra den albanska regeringens genomf&#xF6;rande av de tv&#xE5; projekten (WRIP och ESP) och de &#xE4;r i &#xF6;verensst&#xE4;mmelse med &quot;Resultatstrategi f&#xF6;r Sveriges reformsamarbete med &#xD6;steuropa, V&#xE4;stra Balkan och Turkiet 2014 &#x2013; 2020&quot; samt Sveriges feministiska utrikespolitik.</narrative>
  </description>
